{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the stellar vacuum of the future, mechanical rebellion threatens humanity. Join the Android Resistance and fight for freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/fe99e1458b5b813ad89c9c796db151b7.poster.avif?t=1756507180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/fe99e1458b5b813ad89c9c796db151b7.webm?t=1756507180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/fe99e1458b5b813ad89c9c796db151b7.mp4?t=1756507180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an epic showdown against rebel machines in Android Resistance, a frenetic top-down shooter that challenges your skills and strategy. Take on the role of Adrian-317, the wise Vanguard, and assemble a diverse team of androids, each with their unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/63d54c03819552c331386c423d99b96f.avif?t=1756507180\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span>Face hordes of enemies in intense battles where survival is the only option. Shoot, dodge, and evade enemy attacks to emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.poster.avif?t=1756507180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.webm?t=1756507180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.mp4?t=1756507180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/74314792cc44b4531006e748ac64c27a.avif?t=1756507180\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span> Choose from a range of specialized androids, from the optimistic Alpha-101 to the courageous warrior Sara-977. Each character offers a unique gaming experience, allowing you to choose your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/b8a843647ec620cdbe82ddca3f166742.avif?t=1756507180\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span>Take on powerful bosses, explore dynamic levels, and collect points to unlock new upgrades, characters, and game modes. Your choices determine the fate of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c5c48767579eda60baeb1b.poster.avif?t=1756507180\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c5c48767579eda60baeb1b.webm?t=1756507180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c5c48767579eda60baeb1b.mp4?t=1756507180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for battle! Join the Android Resistance and fight for humanity's freedom against the rebel machines. The future of the galaxy depends on you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A New Face in the Crowd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2905920/b5dba94bc64f88641339c5b2defb2ca368aabe50.jpg"},{"name":"The Hall of Heroes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2905920/cdae3c994220ff2807a3771fad0c57900c8ad18c.jpg"},{"name":"Upgrade Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2905920/13498645b8a2f1ffe613f6724d26ac51ff1e969b.jpg"},{"name":"Hyper-Competent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2905920/4443ea53ef7126b9e8a6916be8c09d928c274283.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Arsenal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2905920/6af50992fcc8da574a9d5e31fb4c0bcd6dc97f79.jpg"},{"name":"Peak of Perfection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2905920/0df00c4754f5a67373572e5a401631d196675856.jpg"},{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2905920/9be40b70008bc82e65f035203907243267efa619.jpg"},{"name":"Mechanical Marathoner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2905920/5963bef1ec1e83d05ba0b4cce320f2a9e9df9e82.jpg"},{"name":"Datapoint Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2905920/511f2b6ec159e6ed7168bbfce47c7f9abe8df006.jpg"},{"name":"Scale Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2905920/3942358f1b7acab96d6905b1cab60c17c3ccbc21.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2905920?t=1756507180","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756507180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756507180","c