ttacks to emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.poster.avif?t=1756507180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.webm?t=1756507180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/06321ddc2cd10d83b9f4ecc99f2b8aa1.mp4?t=1756507180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/74314792cc44b4531006e748ac64c27a.avif?t=1756507180\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span> Choose from a range of specialized androids, from the optimistic Alpha-101 to the courageous warrior Sara-977. Each character offers a unique gaming experience, allowing you to choose your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/b8a843647ec620cdbe82ddca3f166742.avif?t=1756507180\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span>Take on powerful bosses, explore dynamic levels, and collect points to unlock new upgrades, characters, and game modes. Your choices determine the fate of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c5c48767579eda60baeb1b.poster.avif?t=1756507180\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905920/extras/a6f681caa5c